# The face-landmark model and runtime that Wink page turning reads a wink with:
# 17 MB of somebody else's build output, fetched and checksummed by
# fetch-wink-assets.sh. Everything that reads them treats them as optional, so
# a checkout without them still builds and still runs.
lib/mediapipe/

# Wink recordings to replay the judge against. They hold no picture, but they
# do hold a few hundred rows of measurements of somebody's face, so whether any
# given one gets published is the person's decision and not the repository's.
# tests/wink-replay.spec.js skips when there are none.
tests/recordings/

